    <title>Furius</title>
    <id>246107</id>
    <revision>
      <id>16122974</id>
      <timestamp>2005-06-06T10:04:33Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <ip>213.118.98.121</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Furius''' was the [[nomen]] of the ancient [[Rome|Roman]] '''''gens Furia''''', an old family of uncertain origin.

* Furius, [[Pontifex Maximus]] [[449 BC]]-[[431 BC]]

* [[Aulus Furius Antias]], poet ca [[100 BC]]

* [[Marcus Maecius Furius Baburius Caecilianus Placidus]], consul [[343]]

* [[Marcus Furius Bibaculus]], poet [[1st century BC]]

* [[Lucius Furius Camillus (consul 349 BC)|Lucius Furius Camillus]], consul [[349 BC]]
* [[Lucius Furius Camillus (consul 338 BC)|Lucius Furius Camillus]], son of previous, consul [[338 BC]]
* [[Lucius Furius Camillus (consul 325 BC)|Lucius Furius Spurii filius Camillus]], consul [[325 BC]] (second time??)
* [[Marcus Furius Camillus]], hero of [[4th century BC]]
* [[Marcus Furius Camillus (consul AD 8)|Marcus Furius Camillus]], consul [[8|AD 8]]

* [[Furius Crassipes]], husband of [[Cicero]]'s daughter [[Tullia]]

* [[Agrippa Furius Fusus]], consul [[446 BC]]
* [[Spurius Furius Fusus (consul 488 BC)|Spurius (Sextus?) Furius (Medullinus or Fusus?)]], consul [[488 BC]]
* [[Spurius Furius Fusus (consul 481 BC)|Spurius Furius Fusus]] (Fusius), consul [[481 BC]]

* [[Lucius Furius Medullinus (consul 474 BC)|Lucius Furius Medullinus]], consul [[474 BC]]
* [[Lucius Furius Medullinus (tribune 420 BC)|Lucius Furius Medullinus]], consular tribune [[420 BC]]
* [[Lucius Furius Medullinus (consul 413 BC)|Lucius Furius Lucii filius Medullinus]], consul [[413 BC]], [[409 BC]]
* [[Publius Furius Medullinus Fusus]], consul [[472 BC]]
* [[Spurius Furius Medullinus Fusus|Spurius Furius Medullinus Fus(i)us]], consul [[464 BC]]

* [[Gaius Furius Pacilus (consul 412 BC)|Gaius Furius Pacilus]], consul [[412 BC]]
* [[Gaius Furius Pacilus (consul 251 BC)|Gaius Furius Pacilus]], consul [[251 BC]]
* [[Gaius Furius Pacilus Fusus|Gaius (Quintus) Furius Pacilus Fusus]], consul [[441 BC]]

* [[Lucius Furius Philus]], consul [[136 BC]]
* [[Publius Furius Philus|Publius Furius Spurii filius Philus]], consul [[223 BC]]

* [[Lucius Furius Purpureo|Lucius Furius Spurii filius Purpureo]], consul [[196 BC]]

* [[Gaius Furius Sabinus Aquila Timesitheus]], [[praetorian prefect]] [[241]]

== External link ==

* [http://www.livius.org/fo-fz/furius/camillus.html#Furia livius.org info on gens Furia]

