* [[Island Thrush]], &lt;i&gt;Turdus poliocephalus&lt;/i&gt;
* [[Chestnut Thrush]], &lt;i&gt;Turdus rubrocanus&lt;/i&gt;
* [[White-backed Thrush]], &lt;i&gt;Turdus kessleri&lt;/i&gt;
* [[Gray-sided Thrush]], &lt;i&gt;Turdus feae&lt;/i&gt;
