      <text xml:space="preserve">'''&quot;Ligia Lieder (the abstract claustrophobie of the desert)&quot;''' (Javier Adúriz), is a cycle of four songs for [[soprano]] and [[piano]], composed in (1993-1994) by [[Juan Maria Solare]]. [11'25&quot;] It is dedicated to [[Gabriela Liberatori]].

