    <title>Rick Bronson</title>
    <id>246220</id>
    <revision>
      <id>25369661</id>
      <timestamp>2005-10-12T18:06:06Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Sherurcij</username>
        <id>120909</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Rick Bronson''' is a [[United States|US]] [[truck]] [[driving|driver]] who was [[firing|fired]] from his [[employment|job]], by [[The Coca-Cola Company]] (in June [[2003]]), because he was spotted drinking a [[Pepsi]] in the backroom of a store to which he had just delivered.

Bronson alleges that the [[corporation]] fired him because he tried to organise merchandise workers in his [[labor union|union]], the [[Teamsters]]. After the union protested, Bronson got his job back.

==External link==
*http://www.teamster.org/03news/nr_030718_1.htm
----
[[List of people by name]]
[[Category:Truck drivers|Bronson, Rick]]</text>
